## Chosen rule

Walk-forward choice: iforest 1-day p05, stop 3%, target 15.00%, hold 20 sessions.
One percent risk, 20 names at most: terminal 0.000, CAGR -0.880, max drawdown 1.000, Sharpe -1.301.
Quarter-Kelly risk 0.029: terminal 0.000, CAGR -1.000, max drawdown 1.000, Sharpe -1.042.

## Verdict

iforest 1-day p05, stop 3%, target 15.00%, 20 sessions is the walk-forward choice. In the holdout the deduped mean is -0.028 and the matched random mean is -0.016, a difference of -0.012. The bracket does not beat the random book with a positive expectancy. Buying the stock on the anomaly and bracketing it is not an improvement on doing the same trade at random.

